<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian natbank allots 12.08 bln ats in repos.</title>
<headline>Austrian natbank allots 12.08 bln ats in repos.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian national bank said on Friday it had allocated 12.08 billion schillings in two-week securities repurchase agreements, or repos, at a fixed rate of three percent, unchanged from last week.</p>
<p>The central bank said it had filled 12 percent of the bids.</p>
<p>Last week the bank allotted 12.26 billion schillings, filling 12 percent of the bids.</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom, +431 531 12257</p>
</text>
